PRE 4.2.0 (#302, #303 on cursor/p3-issues-279-302-303):

#302 — post-PR #301 cleanup
- contract_p3_wire.h: fl_net_endpoint_t at contract layer (wire rev 4); fl_net_server_addr_t typedef alias; drop net_endpoint.c layout _Static_asserts
- server_shared_db: catalog message transfer_id is UUID v4 (OpenSSL RAND_bytes) with PRIMARY KEY retry (up to 3 attempts)
- FL_CONTRACT_P3_NETWORKING_REV 17

#303 — IPv6 UI/UX (foundation from #280 / PR #301)
- fl_net_endpoint_format: a.b.c.d:port or [addr]:port
- fl_net_route_snapshot6; ifconfig prints inet / inet6 from route tables (loopback inet6 ::1 prefixlen 128)
- Shell: ping6; nslookup and resolve print A + AAAA; server host/join/connected use formatted endpoints; join -bind accepts IPv6 literals
- fl_net_icmpv6_echo_exchange and fl_net_ping6 for loopback ICMPv6
VER_END
